%% EvaporChain — Validator Key Lifecycle (BLS12-381 + ML-DSA + TLS)

flowchart TD
    A[Operator runs node binary<br/>--tendermint-mode --validator-id N] --> B{bls_key.bin exists<br/>at data_dir?}
    B -->|no| C[BlsKeypair::generate#40;#41;<br/>OsRng entropy]
    B -->|yes, 32B| D[from_secret_bytes#40;#41;<br/>load existing keypair]
    B -->|yes, wrong size| E[Log warning, regenerate]
    C --> F[write_secret_file<br/>EVK1 encrypted #40;Argon2id +<br/>XChaCha20-Poly1305#41; if<br/>EVAPORCHAIN_VALIDATOR_KEY_PASS<br/>set; else plaintext + mode 0600]
    F --> G[BLS keypair active]
    D --> G
    E --> F

    H[ML-DSA wallet key] --> I[generate_keypair#40;#41;<br/>encrypt_secret_key]
    I --> J[XChaCha20-Poly1305<br/>master = blake3_derive#40;EVAPORCHAIN_KEY_MASTER#41;]
    J --> K[Store as encrypted hex<br/>in user_db sqlite]

    L[TLS validator cert] --> M[rcgen self-signed<br/>cert + private key in PEM]
    M --> N[Write to data_dir<br/>plaintext + mode 0600]

    G --> O[Sign consensus votes<br/>BLS_DST domain sep]
    G --> P[Sign DA attestations<br/>distinct DST]

    Q[Key rotation:<br/>NOT IMPLEMENTED] -.-> G
    Q -.-> K
    Q -.-> M

    style F fill:#d1e7dd
    style N fill:#fff3cd
    style J fill:#d1e7dd
    style Q fill:#f8d7da

    %% NOTE 2026-04-27 update:
    %% - BLS validator key encryption #40;F#41; landed via commit 0af4bb2
    %%   #40;EVK1: Argon2id + XChaCha20-Poly1305#41;. Opt-in via
    %%   EVAPORCHAIN_VALIDATOR_KEY_PASS env var; --mainnet strict mode
    %%   refuses to start without it.
    %% - TLS validator cert #40;N#41; still plaintext on disk #40;mode 0600#41;
    %%   — mainnet hardening still required for that path.
    %% - Key rotation #40;Q#41; remains unimplemented — operational rotation
    %%   needs a fresh deployment for now.
